# OBOROZUKI MANOR 3F -- Moon Shrine (loft)   (10x8, TILESET_TOWER, ref SproutTower3F)
# The only tower-tileset map: a sealed shrine loft in the roof. Brick walls (0b) on black void (01),
# a pillar screen (05/06/04) splitting outer and inner sanctum, guardian statues (2e/2f) at the altar,
# lantern statues with red orbs (12/13), statues flanking the ladder (31/30).
# Gameplay: two Sages in the outer room; Lady Sayo Oborozuki kneels before the altar -> BOSS.
# Team idea: Espeon, Umbreon, Leafeon, Glaceon + one seasonal mon (ties to Hana/Yuki's eeveelutions).
# Afterwards she returns downstairs and the household opens up (rematches, tea ceremony shop).
# Warps: STUDY ladder 1f (10,14) -> Study ladder 27 (20,2).
tileset tower
ref SproutTower3F
key 1=01 B=0b a=04 b=05 c=06 L=2e R=2f F=08 f=09 G=0a s=12 S=13 m=0d n=0e o=0c j=31 k=30 l=1f
